{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54341","headline":"罢章陵令山居过中峯道者二首 一 · 钱珝","name":"罢章陵令山居过中峯道者二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宁辞园令秩，不改渊明调。\n解印无与言，见山始一笑。\n幽人还绝境，谁道苦奔峭。\n随云剩渡溪，出门更垂钓。\n吾庐青霞里，窗树玄猿啸。\n微月清风来，方知散发妙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}